docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.7z
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.tar.gz
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.SLDPRT
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.SLDASM
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.SLDDRW
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.png
docs/architecture/evidence/**/*.bmp

